DESCRIPTION:Event by Penn Yan Public Library\n214 Main St\, Penn Yan\, NY
 \nPublic\nIn case you missed it\, we’re pleased to offer an updated vers
 ion of this event from July! And we’re so happy to welcome back Rachael 
 Wolverton\, an FLX native now living in the midwest and who has been a sta
 unch opponent of data centers here at home and in her current region. Join
  us to hear about her efforts\, why it’s important to keep data centers 
 away from our beautiful lakes and farmlands\, and how to get involved in t
 his important work. Rachael will be joining us remotely\; guests can atten
 d in-person at the library\, or via Zoom by registering at https://tinyurl
 .com/3mautrhd\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/e
 vent/78466353/20260924180000
