DESCRIPTION:Event by Arts Center Of Yates County\n127 Main St\nPenn Yan\, 
 NY\nPublic\nThis year’s Penn Yan Art Guild show is themed “When Shapes
  Come Together”\, a nod to the ways artists use shapes in creating their
  art. Art Guild members represent a broad range of mediums and styles\, an
 d this show encourages you to discover the many creative ways the artists 
 have made “shapes come together”.\nCome meet the featured artists and 
 learn more about their work at the opening reception. Free admission inclu
 des hors d’oeuvres and beverages.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calen
