DESCRIPTION:Event by CareFirstNY\nEldridge Park\nPublic\nRegister your spo
 t here: https://carefirstny-bloom.kindful.com/.../love-lights-up...\nJoin 
 us for this special community event\, presented by CareFirstNY\, to honor 
 the memory of loved ones lost while celebrating the gift of life!\nWe'll g
 ather at the Hilliard Family Stage in Eldridge Park (access via the Westsi
 de Avenue entrance) to fill the night with both light and music—illumina
 ting the evening with glowing luminaries that symbolize the love and memor
 ies of those we hold dear and lifting spirits with some roof shakin' blues
  tunes by Larry Childs & Night Train.\nThe event is free to attend - lumin
 aries may be reserved for $10 each to decorate and personalize in tribute 
 to your loved one. All proceeds help fund CareFirstNY’s free grief suppo
 rt services and community programs.\nCome early\, bring your lawn chairs\,
  and enjoy a powerful mix of reflection and celebration.\n- - - - - - - - 
 -\nSponsored funds are available for individuals or families who may not b
 e able to afford a luminary (limit 2 per family). To request a sponsored l
 uminary\, please reach out to GriefSupport@carefirstny.org.\n\nSource: FLX
 calendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78441639/20260925183000
