 k Church Elmira\nThe Park Church Elmira\nPublic\nEmpire State VESTival Voi
 ces — FREE Retreat\nSaturday\, September 26\, 2026 | 10 AM–5 PM\nThe P
 ark Church\, Elmira\, NY\nFree to attend | Register by September 23 at www
 .vestny.org\nCurious about Empire State VESTival Voices (ESVV) but not qui
 te ready to audition? Come sing with us for the day!\nDesigned for busy mu
 sicians ages 22+\, ESVV brings singers together for high-level\, concentra
 ted rehearsal and performance experiences without the commitment of weekly
  rehearsals. Think “All-State for Adults”—great music\, excellent co
 nductors\, serious music-making\, and a community of singers who love bein
 g in the room together.\nOur FREE Retreat is your chance to experience ESV
 V before auditioning. Spend the day rehearsing\, making music\, meeting ot
 her singers\, and discovering whether ESVV is right for you.\nNo commitmen
 t to the full season is required. Come sing for the day—and see what ESV
 V is all about.\nNote: Current Vocal-General and Choral Music Educators ar
 e not required to audition to participate in the season.\n\nSource: FLXcal
 endar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466348/20260926100000
