DESCRIPTION:Artists Citra Sasmita and Wayan Kun Adnyana (Rector of the Ind
 onesian Institute of the Arts) will discuss their work and how it addresse
 s issues of gender\, activism\, and the environment on the island of Bali
 \, Indonesia. Their presentations will be followed by a dialogue and Q&A m
 oderated by Kaja McGowan.\nA drawing and puppet-making workshop with upcyc
 led materials will be held by the artists following the talk\, from 2–4P
 M. Anyone interested in joining the workshop should email Kaja McGowan to 
 register.\nThis special event is part of the two-day symposium Sea-ing Ind
 onesia\, organized by the Southeast Asia Program.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar -
  https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78467657/20260926120000
