 blic\nLivers is a collaborative musical project that delivers a sound repr
 esenting a fusion of folk genres. While they have taken inspiration primar
 ily from the Old Time tradition\, the final result remixes a traditional f
 olk feel with hypnotizing trance inducing rhythms and haunting three-part 
 harmonies. Livers is made up of Somer White on vocals and banjo\, Marina K
 hananayev on banjo\, guitar\, and vocals\, Julia Nelson on bodhrán and vo
 cals\, Myles Stokowski on fiddle\, and Howard Kraskow on cello. Life is fo
 r LIVERS!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event
