DESCRIPTION:Event by South Hill Cider\n550 Sandbank Road\, Ithaca\, NY\nPu
 blic\nHank Roberts is one of our local musical luminaries. Most of his per
 formances are touring internationally\, and he will be playing at South Hi
 ll Cider on 2/15/24! He will be playing selections that he is preparing fo
 r his set at the Big Ears Festival this spring.\nBig Ears is a festival st
 arted in 2009. Rolling Stone writing about it “arguably the classiest\, 
 most diverse festival in the country” in 2010. It aims to create “joyf
 ul\, meaningful\, and transcendent cultural experiences” by bringing tog
 ether acclaimed artists and emerging talents.\nHank Roberts is an American
  jazz cellist and vocalist. He plays the electric cello\, and his style is
  a mixture of rock\, jazz\, avant-garde\, folk\, and classical influences.
  He emerged with the downtown New York City jazz scene of the 1980s and is
  associated with its post-modern tendencies.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - http
 s://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466392/20261002173000
LOCATION:South Hill Cider\, 550 Sandbank Road\, Ithaca\, NY 14850\, Ithaca
 \, 14850\, US
