BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LCA "Latin Dance Party" 21+ @ K-House Karaoke & Hub
DTSTART:20261003T123000Z
DTEND:20261004T050000Z
DTSTAMP:20260924T141115Z
UID:0c33b2cbce052b8eb61d7a80a117ddca2def0fef@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Community,Dancing,Music
DESCRIPTION:Event by Latino Civic Association of Tompkins County\, Orozco 
 Gallery and 3 others\nK-House Karaoke & Arts Hub\nDuration: 4 hr 30 min\nP
 ublic\nThe Latino Civic Association of Tompkins County invites you to cele
 brate Hispanic Heritage Month with an unforgettable night of music\, danci
 ng\, and community. As part of this year's Arts & Culture programming in I
 thaca\, NY\, we're bringing people together to celebrate the vibrant rhyth
 ms\, traditions\, and joy of Latin culture. Spend evening dancing to Salsa
 \, Merengue\, Bachata\, Reggeaton & more! Music by The Duchess of Spirit P
 osse & DJ Jona\, bringing the energy and keeping the dance floor moving al
 l night.\nEvent Details:\nSaturday | October 3rd | 8:30 PM – 1:00 AM\n$5
 –$15 CASH or Venmo sliding scale admission\nPartial proceeds will suppor
 t future arts and cultural programming by the Latino Civic Association of 
 Tompkins County.\nLocation: ROOM K (downstairs from K HOUSE Karaoke & Arts
  Hub)\n121 W State St. Ithaca\, NY\nWhether you're a seasoned dancer or ju
 st looking for a fun night out\, everyone is welcome. Come celebrate\, con
 nect\, and support a community organization investing in Latino arts and c
 ulture in Tompkins County.\nLCA is an all-volunteer nonprofit dedicated to
  serving the Latino community of Tompkins County by creating opportunities
  for social\, cultural\, educational\, and civic expression. Follow us on 
 instagram: @lcatompkins & Website to learn more: LCATOMPKINS.ORG\n\nSource
 : FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466346/202610030
 83000
GEO:42.439343;-76.499778
LOCATION:K-House Karaoke & Arts Hub\, 121 West State Street\, Ithaca\, New
  York\, 14850\, United States
