DESCRIPTION:Event by Cornell Cinema\nCornell Cinema\nPublic\n“Watching s
 illy cat videos is good for you.” – The Wall Street Journal\nJoin us a
 t Cornell Cinema for an afternoon of laughter in service of our feline fri
 ends! Cat Video Fest is a joyous communal experience\, only in theaters\, 
 that raises money for local cats in need through partnerships with cat cha
 rities\, animal welfare organizations\, and shelters.\nPresented by Oscill
 oscope Laboratories\, this annual family-friendly festival is a compilatio
 n reel of the latest\, best cat videos culled from countless hours of uniq
 ue submissions and sourced animations\, music videos\, and\, of course\, c
 lassic internet powerhouses. (Keyboard Cat\, we’re looking at you.)\nSpe
 cial event ticket pricing applies! A portion of ticket proceeds will be do
 nated to the SPCA of Tompkins County.\nPresented in collaboration with the
  SPCA of Tompkins County\, the Cornell Feline Health Center\, and Baker In
 stitute for Animal Health.\nPart of our "Worth a Watch" series. Courtesy: 
 Oscilloscope Laboratories\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.l
 y/o9b0uzpj/event/78467620/20261004143000
