DESCRIPTION:Event by State Theatre of Ithaca and DSP Shows\nState Theatre 
 of Ithaca\nPublic\nDSP Shows & The State Theatre of Ithaca Present:\nChris
  Fleming Live\nFriday\, October 23rd\, 2026\nDoors: 7:00pm | Show: 8:00pm
 \nTICKETS ON SALE NOW: https://tixr.com/e/206361\nChris Fleming is a comed
 ian\, actor\, writer\, and one of the most distinctive performers working 
 today. Most recently\, his stand-up special Chris Fleming: Live at the Pal
 ace\, which premiered on HBO and is now streaming on HBOMax\, garnered him
  an Emmy nomination for Outstanding Writing for a Variety Special. Chris c
 an can also be seen on the hit Apple TV series Widow’s Bay.\nAs a stand-
 up\, Fleming has toured theaters nationwide with Chris Fleming Live\, Show
 pig\, Boba Everyday\, and Tricky Tricky\, earning widespread critical accl
 aim. His work has been praised by The New York Times\, The New Yorker\, Fo
 rbes\, Los Angeles Times\, LA Weekly\, Cosmopolitan\, and HuffPost. He has
  been named one of Variety’s “Top 10 Comics to Watch\,” one of Vultu
 re’s “Comedians You Should and Will Know\,” and in their “Best Com
 edy of 2025” roundup\, The New York Times honored him with Best Range. H
 e was recently awarded Comedy Performance of the Year for his latest speci
 al at the 2026 Just for Laughs Festival. His debut stand-up special Hell\,
  produced by Jax and Jen Statsky\, is streaming on Peacock.\nOn the horizo
 n\, Chris will appear in the upcoming feature The Comeback King starring G
 len Powell\, produced and directed by Judd Apatow. He will also be in upco
 ming feature The Catch\, alongside Emma Stone and Chris Pine.\n\nSource: F
 LXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466403/202610232000
 00
