DESCRIPTION:Event by Downtown Penn Yan\, Dave Boyd Music and 4 others\nMai
 n Street\, Penn Yan\, NY\nDuration: 2 hr\nPublic\nTRUNK OR TREAT IS BACK!
 \nGet ready for an afternoon of Halloween fun in downtown Penn Yan!\nJoin 
 us Saturday\, October 24 from 4–6 PM on Main Street for our annual Trunk
  or Treat\, brought to you by the Downtown Business Council of Penn Yan.\n
 Families can enjoy an afternoon of games\, candy\, costumes\, food trucks
 \, and plenty of Halloween fun as local businesses\, organizations\, and c
 ommunity members transform their vehicles into creative and festive trunks
  for trick-or-treating.\nWhether you come dressed as your favorite charact
 er\, show off your best trunk\, or simply join us for the fun\, there’s 
 something for everyone!\nA special thank you to Jan Corning Realty for spo
 nsoring this year's event! And thank you to all of the local businesses\, 
 organizations\, and community members who participate and help make this a
  fun\, free community tradition.\nSaturday\, October 24\n4–6 PM\nMain St
 reet\, Penn Yan\nMore details—including participating trunks\, contests
 \, and activities—will be announced as we get closer!\nCome downtown\, b
 ring the kids\, wear your costumes\, and get ready for some Halloween fun!
 \n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78467442
 /20261024160000
