BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Battle of the Dad Bands @ Hangar Theatre
DTSTART:20261106T230000Z
DTEND:20261107T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20260924T141115Z
UID:b2d6e811302de3229c218fdd2be2f6cd933f3085@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Performing Arts,Music,Competitions
DESCRIPTION:Battle of the Dad Bands\nThe First Ever Rock and Roll Challeng
 e for Charity\nFriday\, November 6 from 6:30–10 pm\nTickets: $25 (on sal
 e Monday\, September 14)\nTompkins County’s top “Dad Bands” will roc
 k out for their favorite charities in an epic “Battle of the Dad Bands
 ” at 6:30 pm\, November 6 at the Hangar Theatre.\nThe First Ever Rock an
 d Roll Challenge for Charity will feature local groups playing sets for th
 e pure love of music and competing to win for their selected charity. Winn
 ers will be selected by audience voting – first place will garner half o
 f the prize money\, second place one-third\, and third place one-sixth.\n
 “Dad Band” is a gender-neutral term for an amateur group of musicians 
 who get together to play their favorite music for the love of rock and rol
 l in someone’s basement\, neighborhood fests\, and their friends’ part
 ies.\nDoors open at 6 pm\; event begins at 6:30 pm\nThe event is being dir
 ected by local Dad Band musician Matt Montague.\nNote: Seating is General 
